{"title": "[FULL] Kuliti Pembelaan Hotman atas Kasus Febrie, Susno Duadji: Orang Baru Belajar Hukum Aja Tahu", "description": "Download the TribunX news app on the Play Store or App Store for a new experience.<br><br>TRIBUN-VIDEO.COM - Former Chief of the Criminal Investigation Unit of the Indonesian National Police, Commissioner General (Ret.) Susno Duadji, responded to several statements by lawyer Hotman Paris Hutapea, who is now the attorney for the former Deputy Attorney General for Special Crimes (Jampidsus), Febrie Adriansyah.<br><br>One of the things Susno highlighted was Hotman&apos;s statement questioning why the National Police Chief did not seek President Prabowo Subianto&apos;s permission before naming Febrie a suspect.<br><br>According to Susno, a lawyer of Hotman Paris&apos;s caliber should already know the answer to this question.<br><br>&quot;Mr. Hotman already knows the answer. It doesn&apos;t need to be a lawyer of Hotman Paris&apos;s caliber; even someone new to law or even someone who isn&apos;t a lawyer already knows the answer,&quot; Susno said.<br><br>Susno emphasized that there is no regulation requiring the National Police to seek the President&apos;s permission to name someone a suspect.<br><br>He also believes that if the National Police dare to name a high-ranking official as a suspect, it means investigators have a strong basis.<br><br>&quot;For the National Police to dare to name a suspect, this isn&apos;t a white man, this is a black man. The President even thanked the National Police,&quot; said Susno.<br><br>However, Susno considered Hotman Paris&apos; defense to be commonplace in the legal profession.<br><br>He believes a lawyer&apos;s job is to find loopholes to defend their clients.<br><br>&quot;So they were bombarded first, saying this wasn&apos;t proven, this violates procedural law. That&apos;s where lawyers come in. This is criminalization, we&apos;ve heard this a thousand times,&quot; he said.<br><br>Susno emphasized that all of the defense&apos;s arguments must be tested through the applicable legal process, not simply through public opinion. (Tribun-Video.com)<br><br>Program: Tribunnews On Focus<br>Host: Nila Irda<br>Video Editor: Dedhi Ajib Ramadhani<br>Uploader: bagus gema praditiya sukirman", "uploadDate": "21 Jul 2026", "uploader": "Tribunnews", "uploaderUrl": "/channel/UCmxAIW7RDDC88EPk4ry16Kg", "uploaderAvatar": "https://piped-proxy.blackeye.id/KNx_zP08sqChiMKsZ9yGoSMLdBoBxASBSc7ZaMXgrvkdNQwWpE_Q2bcmBTL7ZN1m12BUGfrj=s176-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rw?host=yt3.ggpht.com", "thumbnailUrl": "https://piped-proxy.blackeye.id/vi/EW8DYAVJo6s/sddefault.jpg?host=i.ytimg.com&v=6a5f647f", "hls": null, "dash": null, "lbryId": null, "category": "", "license": "YouTube licence", "visibility": "public", "tags": ["hotman paris", "Jaksa Agung Muda Tindak Pidana Khusus", "Jampidsus", "Febrie Adriansyah", "hukum", "korupsi", "jaksa", "presiden", "prabowo subianto"], "metaInfo": [], "uploaderVerified": true, "duration": 1630, "views": 119240, "likes": 633, "dislikes": 4, "uploaderSubscriberCount": 15600000, "uploaded": 1784592000000, "audioStreams": [], "videoStreams": [{"url": "https://piped-proxy.blackeye.id/videoplayback?bui=AZFlqhOEWh_QeaNFMDIOJIPOvox1JgFVtQyT3qeNXQDtmJuraPGadErhWOHsSUFRV06pci5F6HYnOC87&c=ANDROID&clen=75566252&cpn=3FF8WCTHT2p_5PA2&cps=339&dur=1629.762&ei=HhpyaraiDJerqdwPzsHYoQw&expire=1785884286&fexp=51565116%2C51946838&fvip=4&gir=yes&host=rr3---sn-8vq54vox03-ac5e.googlevideo.com&id=o-AOnKB1zXd2MIhPUKL7W5-EUNRqMpMRmWy0H0xqoGIBGe&initcwndbps=2983750&ip=80.176.22.174&itag=18&lmt=1784861352369680&lsig=APaTxxMwRAIgUS2YnQvAYjI65-vaPs7DaJ_crP7DHIQNSJBOA3XK8rwCIAcpX5sM7LJGioru2tWw5eLtuhwuqRKUpVhPiIs7MM8d&lsparams=cps%2Cmet%2Cmh%2Cmm%2Cmn%2Cms%2Cmv%2Cmvi%2Cpl%2Crms%2Cinitcwndbps&met=1785862686%2C&mh=U3&mime=video%2Fmp4&mm=31%2C29&mn=sn-8vq54vox03-ac5e%2Csn-aigl6nzl&ms=au%2Crdu&mt=1785862188&mv=m&mvi=3&pl=20&ratebypass=yes&requiressl=yes&rms=au%2Cau&rqh=1&sig=AE0s2JYwRgIhAK3rfbuV0yanECmgc-JVTILt